0:00-00:03: The camera zooms in for a close-up of the milk frog's head, its eyes large and bright, with skin covered in brown and white patterns that blend seamlessly with the surrounding environment; 
00:03-00:07: The camera pulls back as the milk frog suddenly leaps, following its movement and showcasing its reflection on the water's surface, the reflection clear as a mirror, as if revealing another world; 
00:07-00:11: The milk frog lands on the water's surface, creating ripples that spread outwards, the camera zooms in to highlight its graceful and elegant paddling motion with its front limbs; 
00:11-00:15: The milk frog jumps again, the camera pulls back to reveal its figure against a green backdrop, resembling a dynamic oil painting. 
Background sounds: The gentle lapping of water, the splash of the milk frog's leaps, distant birdsong from the forest, and occasional croaking of frogs.

10-second short video, 9:16 vertical format, resolution, ultra-realistic commercial photography quality, sharp and crystal-clear image with maximum detail;
[Core Subject] A 25–30-year-old Western woman with a slim, well-proportioned figure, long wavy hair with a light blonde gradient, refined and sculpted facial features, fresh natural makeup, wearing a blue halter V-neck maxi dress, paired with a straw handbag, woven sandals, layered bracelets, and rings;
[Action Design]
0–3 seconds: She turns her head toward the dress in her hand, opens her mouth as if explaining, repeatedly points with her left index finger at the dress she is wearing, and the skirt falls naturally with slight movement;
3–6 seconds: She lifts her head to face the camera, raises her left hand with the palm open, keeps holding up the dress with her right hand, shifts her body slightly to the right, and the dress on the hanger sways gently with the movement;
6–10 seconds: She lowers the hanger in her hand to reveal her full upper-body outfit, places her left hand on the hanger bar, angles her body slightly toward the camera, shows a smile, and the skirt fabric gathers naturally in folds;
[Camera Language] Medium shot, eye-level angle, fixed camera, stable frame with no shake;
[Scene Environment] A branded clothing store, indoor retail space, walls covered with identical blue maxi dresses, wooden hangers neatly arranged, recessed warm lighting overhead, light beige flooring, overall clean and bright, with a fresh and soft color palette;
[Lighting Style] Bright indoor commercial lighting, soft warm tones, evenly illuminating the subject and clothing, emphasizing fabric texture and pleat details;
[Consistency Constraints] The same person throughout the entire video, with completely consistent facial features, hairstyle, clothing, and accessories, no deformation, no clipping, no facial distortion;
[Image Quality Requirements], natural skin tone rendering, clear character texture, natural colors, soft lighting and shadows, no blur, no ghosting, no flicker, stable image;
[Voiceover] Look how similar these two dresses are! The one I'm wearing and the one I'm holding—they're basically twins! Perfect for summer, right? Light, flowy, and so cute!
